:: Event: Base attack - lost {"position":"458,1083","size":"100,100"}
<h1 class="ptitle"><<=$game.cabinName ?? ''>></h1>
<br /><br />
<center>		
	<<image 'places/cabin/event_base_attack_capture.jpg' sfw>>				
</center>
<br /><br />

<<set _eventBaseAttackCapturedGirls = 1>>
<<if Object.keys($prevFight).length && setup.percentageChance(50) && $slaves.length > 1>>
	<<set _eventBaseAttackCapturedGirls++>>
<</if>>

As you look outside your gates in the distance you see group of attackers walking away with <strong class="iitem"><<=_eventBaseAttackCapturedGirls>></strong> of your slaves.
<br /><br />

They took: 
<br />
/* Look each one up again before removing: every removal shifts the positions of the people after it */
<<for _eventBaseAttackSlave range setup.npcs.pick($slaves, _eventBaseAttackCapturedGirls)>>
	<div>
		<strong><<=setup.displayName(_eventBaseAttackSlave)>></strong>
	</div>
	<<slaveRemove $slaves.indexOf(_eventBaseAttackSlave)>>
<</for>>
	
<br /><br />
<<link 'Get up'>>
	<<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
<</link>>


